      "lyrics": "From the first boot glow to the last room light / Three small screens make one big voice to-night / Blue-ber-ry keeps the pho-tos late at night / Fris-bee lost her coo-kie name and joined the light / ooh doo wah hmm / ooh doo wah hmm / ooh doo wah hmm / ooh doo wah hmm / From the first boot glow to the last room light / Three small screens make one big voice to-night / We sang the boat then turned the ech-oes high / We learned to blink and let the soft notes sigh / Doo wah la la we glow in green and blue / Pink joins in and makes the old song new / From the first boot glow to the last room light / Three small screens make one big voice to-night",
